<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Roreltute</book>
  <para style="h">Roreltute</para>
  <para style="toc1">Roreltute</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roreltute</para>
  <para style="mt">Roreltute</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josua thih hnu chuan Israel-te chuan Lalpa an râwn a, “Kanan-ho bei tûrin kan zîngah tu hnam nge thawk chhuak hmasa ber ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Juda thlahte thawk chhuak hmasa ber rawh se; ram hi an kutah ka pe a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda thlahte chuan, an unau Simeona thlahte hnênah, “Kan chanpuala ruat ramah hian lo kal ula, Kanan mite hi i beih rawn ang u; keini pawh, chutiang bawkin in ram chanpualah kan lo kal ve ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Simeon-ho chu an thawk ve ta a. Lalpa chuan Kanan mite leh Periz mite chu a hnehtîr a, Bezek-ah mi sîngkhat an hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutah chuan Adoni-bezeka a lo awm a, an bei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a tlân chhuak a, an ûmzui a, an man a, a kutzungpui leh a kezungpui an tansak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adoni-bezeka chuan, “Lal sawmsarih kutzungpui leh kezungpui ka tansak a, chûng chuan ka buhmal tla an chhar ṭhîn. An chunga ka tih angin Pathianin ka chungah a ti ve ta a nih hi,” a ti a. Jerusalem-ah an hruai a, chutah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda thlahte chuan Jerusalem an bei a, an la a, mi an that a, khua chu an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi zawhah Juda thlahte chu tlângram te, tlâng bulṭhut te leh Negeb hmuna awm Kanan-ho chu bei tûrin an thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hebron khua, Kiriat-arba tih ṭhin chu an bei a, Sesai-ho te, Ahiman-ho te leh Talmai-ho te chu an hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Juda thlahte chu Debir bei tûrin an kal a; tûn hma chuan chu khua chu Kiriat-sefer tih a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaleba chuan, “Kiriat-sefer beia, han la thei chu, ka fanu Aksaii nupuiah ka pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaleba nau Kenaza fapa Othniela chuan a la a; a fanu chu nupuiah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An inneih ni chuan a pa hnêna ram dîl tûrin Othniela chuan a lo nawr a. A sabengtung chung aṭang chuan a lo chhuk a, Kaleba chuan, “Eng nge i duh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mal min sâwmsak teh; chhim lam ram rovah min awmtîr a, tuihna awmna min pe tel rawh,” a ti a. Kaleba chuan chuanchung leh chuanhnuai tuihna awmna chu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mosia puzawn thlah, Ken-hote chu Juda thlahte nên Tûmzâwl khua an tih Jeriko aṭang chuan Arad khaw chhim lam Judai ram thlalêrah an kal a, chûnga awmte zîngah chuan an awm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda thlahte chu Simeon-ho nên an thawk chhuak a, Zefat khuaa awm Kanan mite chu an bei a; khua chu an tichhe vek a, a hmingah Horma an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gaza te, Askelon te, Ekron te leh an chhehvêl khuate chu Juda thlahte chuan an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda thlahte chu a awmpui a, a tlângrama awmte chu an hnawt chhuak a; phaia awmte erawh chuan thîr tawlailîr an nei a; Juda thlahte chuan an hnawt chhuak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia thu angin Hebron chu Kaleba an pe a; ani chuan Anaka fa pathumte chu a hnawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte chuan Jerusalem a awm Jebus mite chu an luhchhuak lo; Jebus mite chu Benjamina thlahte nên Jerusalem-ah tûn thlengin an la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josefa thlahte pawh Lalpa chuan a awmpui a, Bethel bei tûrin an thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tûn hma chuan Bethel chu Luz tih a ni. Khaw en thlithlai tûr an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi pakhat hi khua aṭangin a lo chhuak a, enthlatute chuan, “Khawpui luh rûkna min hrilh la, eng mah kan tih lo vang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawpui luhna chu a kawhhmuh a, khua chu an la a, khandaihin mi an that ṭeuh va; chu mi erawh chu a chhûngte nên an zuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chu Hit ramah a pêm a, khua a siam a, a hmingah Luz a vuah a; tûn thlengin chu chu hmingah a la pu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Manasea thlahte chuan Beth-sean khuaa awm te, Taanak khuaa awm te, Dor khuaa awm te, Ibleam khuaa awmte leh Megido khuaa awm te, Kanan-ho chu, an chhehvêl khuaa awmte nên an hnawt chhuak lo. Kanan mite chu an la awm ve ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mite an lo chak deuh hnu erawh chuan chhiah khuaah an siam a, an hnawt chhuak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Efraim-ho chuan Gezer khuaa Kanan mi awmte chu an hnawt chhuak lo. Kanan mite chu an zîngah Gezer khuaah chuan an awm ve ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun-ho chuan Kitron leh Nahalal khuaa awmte an hnawt chhuak lo. Kanan-ho chu an zîngah an la awm ta zêl a; mahse, chhiahhlawhah an siam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aser-ho chuan Ako khuaa awm te, Sidon khuaa awm te, Ahlab khuaa awm te, Akzib khuaa awm te, Helba khuaa awm te, Afek khuaa awm te, Rehob khuaa awmte an hnawt chhuak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aser-ho chu Kanan-ho zîngah an awm ve mai a, an hnawt chhuak lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Beth-semes khuaa awm te, Beth-anat khuaa awmte chu Naftali-ho chuan an hnawt chhuak lo; chûng laia Kanan-ho awmte nên an awm ho va; Beth-semes leh Beth-anata awmte erawh chu chhiah khuaah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amor-ho chuan Dana thlahte chu tlângramah an hnawt tawm a, an awmnaa an luh an phal lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harhares-ah te, Aijalon-ah te, Saalabin khuaah te chuan Amor-ho an ṭang tlat a; mahse, Josefa thlahte chu an chak zâwk deuh va, chhiah khuaah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sela hmâr lamah Amor-ho ramri chu Akrabim kalkhân a kal tlang a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilgal aṭangin Lalpa Vântirhkoh Bokim khuaah a lo kal a, Israel-te hnênah chuan, “Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak che u a, in pate hnêna pêk ka tiam ramah chuan ka thlen che u a; ‘ka thuthlung hi ka bawhchhe ngai lo vang; rama lo awmte nên chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thuthlung in siam tûr a ni lo va, an maichâmte in ṭhiatsak tûr a ni’ ka ti a; mahse, ka thu awih duh lovin eng thil nge in tih tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che u, in hmaah hêngho hi ka hnawt chhuak dâwn lo: in tân hmêlma an ni ang a, an pathiante be tûrin an zâwl thlu ngei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkohvin chûng thu a han sawi zawh chuan Israel-te chu an ṭap ta hawm hawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, chu khua chu Bokim an ti ta a ni. Chutah chuan Lalpa hnênah thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josua chuan Israel mite chu a ṭintîr a; mahni chan ram ṭheuh luah tûrin an kal ta sang sang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josua dam chhûng zawng chuan Israel mite chuan Lalpa rawng an bâwl a. Josua thih hnuah pawh, Israel upaho, Lalpa thiltih hmu phâkte dam chhûng chu a rawng an bâwl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Nuna fapa Josua chu kum za leh sâwma upa a nihin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gaza tlâng hmâr lam, Efraim tlângrama ama ram chanpual Timnat-heres-ah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng upaho pawh chu an thi fai a, Lalpa hre ngai lo, Israel-te tâna a thiltih hre ve pha lo, ṭhangthar an lo ṭhang lian a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti a, Baal-te kha an be ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu, an pate Pathian, Lalpa chu an hawisan a, an chhehvêla awm pathiante lam chu an hawi a, an be ve ta a: Lalpa chu an tithinur ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hawisanin Baal te, Astarte te chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te chungah, Lalpa chu a thinur ta êm êm a, suamhmangte a rawktîr a; an vêla awm hnam dangte kutah a pe a, an ngam ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Indo tûra an thawh chhuah apiangin a sawi ang ngeiin Lalpa chu an lamah a ṭang ta awzâwng lo va, an mangang êm êm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan anmahni sawisatute laka chhantu tûr hruaitute zawng a pe ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />mahse, chûng hruaitute thu chu an ngaithla duh lo va, pathian dang an ûm a, chibai an bûk leh mai ṭhîn. An pate chuan Lalpa thupêkte chu an zâwm a; mahse, an pate awm dân chu an zâwm ve duh ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hruaitute a rawn pêk khân, a pêka chu a awmpui a, a dam chhûng chu an hmêlmate lakah a hum ṭhîn; anmahni tiretheia rapbettute avânga an rûm chu Lalpa chuan a khawngaih ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An hruaitu chu a thih chuan an lamlêt a, an pate ai mahin an khawlo zâwk ṭhîn; pathian dang biak leh chibai bûk an uar sauh va, hnam dang tih dân tinrêng an la a, an luhlul a zual ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel-ho chungah Lalpa thinrim chu a alh ṭhîn a, “An pate zâwm tûra ka tih ka thuthlung chu he chite hian an bawhchhia a, ka aw lah an ngaithla duh hek lo; Josua a thiha, hnam dang a hnawh chhuah lohte kha
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kei pawhin ka hnawt chhuak tawh bîk lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />chûngho chu, an pate angin ka kawng an zawh dâwn nge dâwn lo fiah nân ka hmang dawn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, Josua kha, hêngho hi a hnawhchhuahtîr mai lo va, a awmtîr ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanan ram rûnnaa tel pha lote fiah nân hêng hnam ṭhenkhat hi Lalpa chuan a la zuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel thlah, ṭhang lo thar zêl te, indonaa la tel ngai lohoten indo an zir theih nân a zuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûngte chu: Filistia lal panga te, Kanan mi zawng zawng te, Zidon mi te, Lebanon tlâng, Baal-hermon leh Hamat kalkhâna awm Hiv-ho te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An pate hnêna Lalpa thupêk, Mosia a hrilh kha, Israel-te chuan an zâwm dâwn nge dâwn lo tih tilang chiang tûrin hêng mite hi a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-te chu Kanan mi te, Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te zîngah an chêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûnghote nên chuan nupui pasal an inneih pawlh a, an pathiante chu an be ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti a, an Pathian, Lalpa chu an hawisan a, Baal-te leh Aseri-te chu an be ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chu Israel-te chungah a thinur a, Aram-Naharaim ram lal Kusan-risathaima a hnehtîr a. Israel-ho chu a thuhnuaiah kum riat an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel-te chuan Lalpa chu an au va; Kenaza fapa, Kaleba nau, Othniela chu Lalpa chuan Israel-te chhan chhuak tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chu a chungah a awm a, Israel-te chu a ho ta a. Indo tûrin a thawk chhuak a, Lalpa chuan Aram-Naharaim lal Kusan-risathaima chu a hnehtîr a, a kut ata Israel-te chu a chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An ram chu kum sawmli chhûng a râlmuang a. Kenaza fapa Othniela chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti leh a. Lalpa chuan Moab lal, Eglona chu Israel-te ai chuan a tichak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amon mite leh Amalek mite a ṭanrualpui a, Israel-te chu a bei a, a hneh a; tûmzâwl khawpui Jeriko chu a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te chu Moab lal Eglona hnuaiah kum sâwm leh kum riat an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, Israel-ten Lalpa chu an au va, chhantu tûr a pe a. Chu mi chu Benjamin thlah, Gera fapa, Ehuda, veikhawr a ni. Israel mite chuan Moab lal Eglona chu thilpêk an thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ehuda chuan chemte hriam tawn, tawng khat dâwn laia sei a chher a, a puan hnuai, a malpui ding lamah chuan a thukru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moab lal Eglona chu pa thau zet hi a ni a. Ehuda chuan thilpêk chu a han pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thilpêk a pêk zawh chuan a kengtute chu a tîr haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gilgal lung khur aṭangin ani chu a kîr leh a, “Lalber hnênah thurûk thlen tûr ka nei e,” a ti a. Ani chuan a ṭhuihruaite hnênah, “Min chhuahsan teh u,” a ti a. An chhuahsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pindan chungnung thawveng takah chuan amah chauhvin a lo ṭhu a. Ehuda chuan, “I hnênah Pathian thuchah sawi tûr ka nei,” a ti a. A ṭhutna ata chu a lo tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ehuda chuan a vei lam chuan a khêl ding lama chemte chu a phawi a, a dulah chuan a vit ta thawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chemte fawng chu a tlum hial a, a fawng a pil avâng chuan a phawi lo; hnung lamah chemte lu chu a lawr tut mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bathlarah Ehuda chu a chhuak a, pindan chungnung chu a khâr a, a kalh hnan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A chhuah daih hnu chuan lal chhiahhlawhte chu an lo kal a, pindan kawngka chu a lo inkalh a. ‘A pindan rilah a daikal a ni ngei ang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rei tâwk ta nia an hriat hnu chuan chabi an la a, kawngka chu an han hawng a, an pu chu a thi a; chhuatah a lo lum reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An buai liai liai chhûng chuan Ehuda chu a chhuak a, lung khur a kal pêl a, Seira-ah a tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Efraim tlângram a han thlen chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a, Israel-te chuan tlângram aṭang chuan an zui chhuk a, anin hma a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnênah, “Min zui rawh u, in hmêlma Moab-ho chu in kutah Lalpa chuan a pe ta e,” a ti a. Ani chu an zui chhuk a, Jordan lui kai chu Moab-ho an chhuhsak a, tu mah an kaitîr lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Moab-ho chu mi sîngkhat lai an that a ni, mi hleitling tak tak, an pasalṭha rualte chu; tu mah tlân chhuak an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Israel-te chuan Moab-ho chu an titlâwm a. Ramah chuan kum sawmriat chhûng râlmuangin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani thih hnu chuan Anata fapa Samgara pawhin Filistia mi zaruk zet bâwng chhunna tiangin a vaw hlum a, ani pawhin Israel-te chu a chhan chhuak ve a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ehuda thih hnu chuan Israel-ten Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thuin Kanan lal Jabina chuan Israel-te a hneh a, Hazor khuaah a lal a; a sipai hotu chu Haroset-goim-a awm Sisera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thîr-tawlailîr zakua a nei a, kum sawmhnih chhûng chu Israel-te a tirethei êm êm a, Israel-te chuan Lalpa an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlneinu, Debori, Lapidota nupui chu Israel-ho zînga thusa ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Efraim tlângrama Bethel leh Rama khaw inkâr, Debora khuaa tûm thing hnuaiah a ṭhu a, Israel mite chuan a hnênah thu an rawn thlen ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kedes-naftali-a awm Abinoama fapa Baraka chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Israel-te Pathian chuan ‘Naftalia leh Zebulun thlahte aṭangin mi sîngkhat hruaiin Tabor tlâng lamah kal rawh,’ a ti che a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kanan lal Jabina sipai hotu Sisera chu a thîrtawlailîrte leh a sipaite nên Kison luiah ka rawn hruai ang a, i kutah ka rawn pe dâwn a che a tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Baraka chuan, “I kal ve dâwn chuan ka kal ang a, i kal dâwn loh chuan ka kal bîk lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Debori chuan, “Ka kal ve nâng e; i kal pawhin i ropui phahna tûr a nih dâwn loh hi; Lalpa chuan Sisera chu hmeichhia a thahtîr dâwn e,” a ti a. Debori chu a tho va, Baraka nên Kedes an pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Baraka chuan Naftali leh Zebulun-ho a ko khâwm a, mi sîngkhat chuan an zui a, Debori pawh a kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ken mi Hebera chu Mosia puzawn Hobaba thlah a ni a, Ken-ho zîng ata chu a tla hrang a, Elon-Bazananim bul Kedes vêlah chuan bûk a rawn khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tabor tlâng lamah Abinoama fapa Baraka a kal thu Sisera chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sisera chuan a thîr-tawlailîr zakua chu a khalh khâwm a, Haroset-goim aṭanga a sipai zawng zawng chu Kison luiah chuan a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Debori chuan Baraka hnênah, “Tho teh, vawiin hian Lalpa chuan i kutah Sisera hi a pe dâwn. Lalpa chuan i hma a hruai a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a. Tichuan, Baraka chu Tabor tlâng aṭang chuan a sipai sîngkhat nên an chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Baraka chuan Sisera chu khandaihin a bei thut a, Lalpa chuan Sisera chu a thîr-tawlailîrte leh a sipaite nên a tichiai zo ta a. Sisera chu a tawlailîr ata a chhuk a, kein a tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Baraka chuan tawlailîrte leh sipaite chu a ûm a, Haroset-goim thlengin a ûm a, Sisera sipaite chu a sât hlum vek a, pakhat mah tlân chhuak an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sisera chu Ken mi, Hebera nupui Jaeli puan inah a tlân lût a, Hazor lal Jabina leh Hebera chhûngte chu an inrem rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sisera hmuak tûrin Jaeli chu a tlân chhuak a, “Lo tlân teh, ka pu, ka hnênah lo biru rawh; hlau rêng rêng suh,” a ti a. A puan inah chuan a tlân lût a, puanin a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sisera chuan, ‘Tui in tûr mi han pe teh, ka tui a hâl e,” a ti a. Bâwnghnute bûr a hawng a, a intîr a; amah chu a khuh leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sisera chuan, “Puan in kawngkaah khân awm la, mi an lo kala, ‘Hetah awm an awm êm?’ tia an zawh che chuan, ‘awm lo’ i ti dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hebera nupui chuan puan in khenbehna leh tuboh a la a; a muthilh hnu chuan zawi têin a va lût a; a bekah khenbehna chu a khêng lût a, leiah a khêngbêt ta tlat a; a mu nghet hle a, a thi nghâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Baraka chuan Sisera chu a rawn ûm a, Jaeli chu hmuak tûrin a lo chhuak a, a hnênah, “Lo kal teh, i mi zawn chu ka entîr ang che,” a ti a. An lût dûn ta a, Sisera chu a lo thi reng a, puan in khenbehna chu a bekah a bûr ngur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Israel-te hmaah Kanan lal Jabina chu Lalpa chuan a titlâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kanan lal Jabina chu Israel-te chuan an hneh zui ta zêl a, a tâwpah phei chuan an tiboral thei ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Debori leh Abinoama fapa Baraka chuan hetiang hian hla an sa a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hotu ṭhaten an ho meuh chuan Mipuiin an zui dûl dûl mai, châk takin, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalte u, ngaithla ula, Hotute u, bengchhi teh u; Lalpa fakin zai ka vâwr dâwn e. Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu ka chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Seir tlâng i kalsan a, Edom ram i chhuahsan khân, Lîrpui a nghîng a, khuangruah a sûr a, Ruahthimpui a lo hâwn kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan tlângte an khûr a, A saw Sinai tlângpui meuh pawh saw A sai hlawk hlawk e, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hmaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anata fa Samgara leh Jaeli vânglai khân Lampui a ṭhing ṭhuap a, Khualzinte chuan kawngṭum an zawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Debori a lo chêt hmaa, Israel-nu a lo thawh hma khân, An awm lo ve, Israel zîngah, An awm lo thusa thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miten pathian dang biak an thlang, Kan ramah hian indo a chhuak ta a. Israel mi sîngli zîngah Phawsial leh fei chawi awm maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka va han lainat êm, Israel hruaitute; Châk taka zuitute pawh chu: Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabengtung vâr chunga chuang ṭhînte u, Nangni ṭhutphah dûpa ṭhute pawhin. Lamtluang zawhtute nên he thu hi puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuikhura zai mite thâwm chu: Lalpa thil tih ṭhatzia an sawi, Israel rama thil ropui a tih chu an hril, Kulh kawngkaahte pawh an pung khâwm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Harh teh, harh teh, Debor, Harh la, zai han vâwr teh: Abinoama fapa, tho teh, Barak, tho teh, Râl tam tak salah hruai dum dum rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi lian rualte pawh chuan an zui ve a, Hmêlma dopui tûrin Lalpa mite an chhuk thla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Efraim ram aṭangin lui lam an pan, An unau Benjamin-ten an rawn pui a, Makir-ho mi liante an chhuk thla ve Zebulon-ho lal liante nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isakar mi lianten Debori an zui; Berâm huanga ṭhut mai a hun ta lo, An sûl zuiin luipui kamah an pung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ran rual awihna phênglâwng tum ngaithlaa, Berâm huanga ṭhut mai a hun ta lo, Reuben-ho lah an inhnial buai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gad-ho pawh Jordan râlah an awm daih si. Dana chuan lawng chauh a lungkham a, Aser pawh tuipui kamah, Vaukamah a vuaicha hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun leh Naftali erawh chuan Thih dâwn lovin an bei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An lalte chuan an rawn bei ve, Kanan ram lalte chu an ṭang hle a, Megido lui kam Tanak-ah chuan Râllâk tûr rêng an nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vâna arsite pawh an che ve a, Lamtluang an zawh pahin Sisera chu an bei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kison lui lian chuan a la a, A ni, hmânlai Kison lui chuan a lên a, Khawi nge, ka’n ûm duai duai teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sakawrten phei an vâwr a, An ter ut ut mai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Meroz khua chu ânchhia lawh r’u; A chhûnga mite chu lawh bawrh bawrh r’u,’ Lalpa pui tûrin an lo kal duh lo va, hmêlma an bei duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jaeli nge nge a chhuanawm e, hmeichhia azawngah, Hebera nupui, Ken-nu mawlh hi Puan ina chêng zîngah a lawr fâl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tui a dîl a, hnutetui a intîr a, No mawi takin a dak a rawn kensak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puan in khenbehna a rawn keng a, Themthiam tuboh a chawi, Dim lo lêkin a chhu, Sisera chu, a tuboh chuan Thlunglu pawpin a chhu, A bekbawrah a khêng tlang zawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A awp rup a, a let thla e, A ke bulah a thal dêr a, A thi bul mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sisera nu chuan a lo thlîr a, Tukverhah te a bih thla a, ‘A tawlailîr a lo va haw har ve, A sakawrte chu an va muang awm vei êm,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ṭhiannu fing ber chuan a lo hnêm a, Mahni a inṭawng thlamuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Man belh tûr an zawng a ni ngei ang, An insem khawtlai a ni phawt ang: Nula pahnih khat man belh tûr an vai a ni ang e, Sisera hawn atân puan mawi deuh an dap a ni ang, Lalnu bah tûr an zawng khawtlai a ni ang e,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa , i hmêlmate chutiang chuan ral sela, I ṭhiante erawh chu ni chhuak angin êng phût rawh se,’ tiin. Kum sawmli chhûng a ram chu a râlmuang a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti a; kum sarih chhûng Midian-ho hnuaiah a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Midian-ho chu Israel-te ai chuan an chak a, tlâng pangah bihrûkna tûr kua an siam a, pûkah te an biru a, kulh te an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midian-ho te, Amalek-ho te leh thlalêra chêngho te chu an lo kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bûk an khuar a, Israel-te thlai chînte chu an tichhe zêl a, Gaza thlengin Israel ramah chuan ei tûr a awm lo; berâm te, bâwng te, sabengtung te an la zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ran rualte an rawn khalh a, puan inte an rawn keng a, khau puang ang mai an ni; ram chu an tikawlh fer fur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-te chu an rethei ta êm êm a. Israel-te chuan Lalpa an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midian-ho vânga Israel-te mangang au chu Lalpan a lo hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te hnênah zâwlnei pakhat a tîr a, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aigupta ram aṭangin bawiha in awm kha ka hruai chhuak che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta hotu leh nangmahni tiduhdahtute kut ata ka chhan chhuak che u a, he ram hi ka pe che u a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chu ka ni. Amor-ho rama awm in ni a, an pathiante chu zah suh u ka ti che u a, ka thu in awih duh lo,’ a ti e” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chu Ofra khuaah a kal a, Abiezer mi Joasa sasaw bulah chuan a ṭhu ta a; Joasa fapa Gideona chuan uain sâwr khurah Midian-ho hmuh loh tûrin buh a chîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chu a hmu a, ani chuan a hnênah, “Nang mi huaisen, Lalpa chu i hnênah a awm.” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “Ka pu, Lalpa chu kan hnêna a awm si chuan hêng thil zawng zawng hi engtizia nge kan chunga a thlen le? Kan paten a thiltih ropui tak tak min hrilhte kha khawiah nge a awm tâk? Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram aṭangin min hruai chhuak maw? Tûnah zawng, Lalpa hian min paihthla a, Midian-ho kutah min pe ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a lam a hawi a, “I chak khawp alâwm, Israel-te chu Midian-ho kut ata hi chhan chhuak ta che, ka tîr che a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “Ka pu, engtin nge Israel-te chu ka chhan chhuah ang le? Manasea thlah zînga pachhe ber chhûng kan ni a, kan chhûng zîngah lah a naupang ber ka ni si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka awmpui zêl dâwn che alâwm. Midian-ho chu mi pakhat ang lekin i hneh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “Min khawngaih la, Lalpa chu i ni ngei tih hriatna tûr min tihsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kal bo mai lo la, thilpêk ka han la ang a, i ke bulah ka han dah ang e,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “I lo kal leh hma loh chu ka lo awm reng ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gideona chu inah a lût a, keltê a talh a, dawidim telh loh chhangphut kg. sâwm a keng bawk a. Sa chu fawngah a dah a, a tui chu bêlah. Sasaw thing hnuaiah chuan a rawn kensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan, “A sa leh chhang dawidim telh loh kha la la, lung chungah khân dah la, a tui kha leih rawh,” a ti a. Chutiang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan a tiang ken hmâwr chuan sa leh chhang dawidim telh loh chu a khawih a; lung aṭang chuan mei a lo chhuak a, sa leh chhang chu a kâng ral ta a. Lalpa Vântirhkoh chu a kal bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gideona chuan Lalpa Vântirhkoh ngei a ni tih a hre ta a, “Khai aw, Aw Lalpa P athian, lalpa Vântirhkoh nên inhmachhawnin kan inhmuh tâk chu!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Thlaphâng suh, thlamuang takin awm rawh, i thi lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutah chuan Gideona chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, Lalpa Salom a vuah a. Abiezer mite rama Ofra khuaah chu chu tûn thlengin a la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Lalpan a hnênah, “I pa bâwngpa leh bâwngpa dang kum sariha upa kai la, i pa siam Baal maichâm chu tichhia la, a bula Aseri phun pawh chu kit rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maichâm chhe chim vûm chungah chuan i Pathian, Lalpa tân maichâm rinawm tak siam la, bâwngpa pahnihna kha hâlral thilhlanah hlân rawh; a hâlna thingah i kih thlûk Aseri kha hmang ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Gideona chuan a chhiahhlawh sâwm a hruai a, Lalpa sawi ang chuan a ti a. A chhûngte leh khuaa mite a hlauh avângin chhûnah chuan a ti lo, zânah a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tûk zînga mite an han thawh chuan Baal maichâm chu a lo chim a, a bula Aseri lim thing phun a lo tlu chu an hmu a; maichâm tharah chuan bâwngpa pahnihna kha hâlral thilhlanah an lo hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tu tih nge?” an inti a. An han zâwt chiang a, “Joasa fapa Gideona tih a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khuaa mite chuan Joasa hnênah, “I fapa kha han hruai chhuak rawh, kan that dâwn a ni. Baal maichâm a ṭhiat a, a bula Aseri phun pawh a kit a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joasa chuan chutia rawn titute chu a chhâng a, “Baal hi in ṭan a, chhan in tum em ni? Baal ṭan apiang chu tûkin zîngah la la hian thah in ni ang. Pathian a nih tak tak chuan amah inhum ang hmiang, ama maichâm alâwm an tihchhiatsak,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, chumi ni chuan a hmingah Jerubaala an sa ta a, ‘a maichâm a tihchhiat avângin Baala chuan rawn bei ang hmiang’ an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midian-ho te, Amalek-ho te leh thlalêra chêng te chu an pung khâwm a, Jezreel ruamah bûk an rawn khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chu Gideona hnênah a awm a, Abiezer mite koh khâwm nân tawtawrâwt a hâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Manase-ho te, Aser-ho te, Zebulun-ho te leh Naftali-ho te chu a chah khâwm a, amah tâwk tûrin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gideona chuan Lalpa hnênah “Min hmanga Israel mite hi chhan chhuah i duh tak meuh a nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />en teh, hruihah berâm hmul hi ka dah ang a, berâm hmulah chauh dai a tlâka, a vêl lei a ro si chuan i sawi angin min hmangin Israel-te hi i chhan chhuak dâwn a ni tih ka hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A tûk zîngah an han thawh chuan berâm hmul chu a han sâwr a, no khat dâwn lai dai a sâwr chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “Ka chungah thinrim suh aw, ka han sawi leh teh ang, ka han en chhin leh ang e: Zânin chu berâm hmul hi ro phak sela, a vêl lei hi chu daiin huh hnêp teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Pathianin berâm hmul chu a tihul phiang a, leiah erawh chuan dai a tlâktîr ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerubaala an tih Gideona chuan a hnêna lo kal zawng zawng chu zîng takah a thawhpui a, Harod bulah bûk an khuar a. Midian-ho chuan an awmna hmâr lam ruam More-ah bûk an khuar ve bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Gideona hnênah, “I mite hi an tam êm mai, in kuta Midian-ho ka pêk chuan, Israel-te hian min uankhum ang e, anmahni hneh emaw an ti mai ang asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipui hnênah, ‘Tu pawh, indo huphurha thlaphâng apiang chu Gilead tlâng aṭang hian haw mai rawh se,’ tiin tlângau rawh se,” a ti a. Mi sînghnih leh sânghnih chu an haw a, sîngkhat chu an la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Gideona hnênah, “Mi an la tam lutuk fo, luiah hruai thla la, ka thlan chhuahsak ang che. ‘Hei hi kal rawh se,’ ka tih chu kalpui la, ‘hei chu kal suh se,’ ka tih chu hawtîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, luiah a hruai thla a, Lalpa chuan Gideona hnênah, “Ui anga tui liak chu dah hrang la, ṭhingṭhia tui dâwt chu i dah hrang bawk dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuta tui thâla liak chu mi zathum an ni a, mi dang zawng chuan ṭhingṭhiin tui an dâwt a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Gideona hnênah, “Mi zathum, kuta tui thâla liakho hmang hian ka chhan dâwn che u a, Midian-ho chu in kutah ka pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei tûr kengtute leh tawtawrâwt pûte leh mi zathum tih loh, mi dang chu an in lamah a hâwntîr ta vek a. Midian-ho bûk chu an thlang lawk phaiah a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zânah Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Tho la, an bûkah zu chhuk rawh, i kutah ka pe tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmaha kal i hlauh deuh chuan i tlangvâl hruai Pura kha hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An titi zu ngaithla la, chumi hnu chuan an bûk zu beih i châk hle ang,” a ti a. Pura nên chuan hmêlma sipai awmna hmâwrtawng berah chuan an zu kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midian-ho te, Amalek-ho te leh thlalêra chêng te chu zâwlah chuan an awm hmur mai a, khau puang ang mai an ni, an sanghâwngseite pawh ṭiau vaivut anga chhiar sên loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideona te an zu thlen thlâk chuan mi pakhatin a ṭhian chu a mumang a lo hrilh a, “Mumang ka nei a, kan bûkah hian barli chhang a lo lum a, bûk chu a rawn delh a, a delh thal dêr a, a pêr vek mai zu nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ṭhian chuan “Joasa fapa Gideona khandaih lo chu eng nge ni ta ang? Chu Israel-pa kutah chuan Midian-ho hi Pathianin a pe ta a nih chu!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gideonan mumang leh a awmzia an sawi chu a hriatin Pathian chibai a bûk a; Israel-te bûkah a chho va, an hnênah, “Tho teh u, Midian-ho rual chu Lalpa chuan in kutah a pe ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi zathum chu pâwl thumah a ṭhen a; bêl ruak leh a chhûnga meichher awm, tawtawrâwt nên a pe ṭheuh va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an hnênah, “Min en ula, ka tih angin ti ve zêl ang che u, an bûk sir ber ka thlen huna ka tih ang chu in ti ve dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei leh ka kalpuiten tawtawrâwt kan ham chuan kil tinah hâm ve ula, ‘ Lalpa leh Gideona tân’ tiin au dur dur ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gideona leh a ho mi za te chu zânlaiah, râl vêng an inthlâk fel hlim hlawlah bûk hmâwrtawng chu an thleng a; an tawtawrâwt chu an hâm a, an bêl ken chu an vaw keh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pâwl dangte chuan an tawtawrâwt chu an hâm a, bêl chu an tikeh a, meichher chu kut lehlamin an chhi a, tawtawrâwt chu lehlama vuanin an hâm a, “Khandaih chu, Lalpa leh Gideona tân!” tiin an au ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmêlma bûk hual chuan mahni dinna tûr ṭheuhvah an ding a; bûka sipaite chu an au ruan ruan a, an tlânchhe ta chum chum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt zathum chu an hâm tuar tuar a; Lalpa chuan hmêlma zawng zawng chu anmahni leh anmahni a insahtîr ta sawk sawk a. Zarethan lamah Beth-sita thlenga tlânchhiate an awm a, Tabat bul Abel-mehola ri thlenga tlânchhia pawh an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naftalia thlah te, Asera thlah te leh Manasea thlah, Jordan chhak lam leh thlang lama awm te chu Midian-ho ûm tûrin an pun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gideona chuan Efraim tlângramah mi a tîr chhuak bawk a, “Lo chhuak ula, Midian-ho rawn bei ula, Midian-hovin Jordan leh lui dang an kân tûr lo châng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midian hotu pahnih Oreba leh Zeeba chu an man a, Oreb lung hmunah Oreba chu an that a, Zeeb grep sâwrkhurah Zeeba chu an that a. Jordan râlah Oreba leh Zeeba lu chu Gideona hnênah an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim mite chuan Gideona hnênah, “Midian-ho bei tûra min sâwm ve lo hi engtizia nge?” an ti a, an hau na hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Nangnin in tih ṭhin ai chuan ka thil tih ve chhun hi eng tham mah a ni nêm! Nangni Efraim-hovin in tih chhunte pawh keini hnam tê, Abiezer-ho tih ai chuan a ropui daih alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin in kutah Midian hotu lian Oreba te, Zeeba te a pe che u a, kei chuan eng tham mah tih ka nei hlei nem,” a ti a. Chutianga a ṭawng hnu chuan an thinur pawh chu a dai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gideona leh a mi zathum chuan Jordan an kai a, an chau hle mai a, hmêlmate chu an ûm zêl bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sukoth khaw mite hnênah chuan Gideonan, “Midian lal Zeba leh Zalmuna kan ûm a, ka hote hi an hah hle tawh a, khawngaih takin ei tûr lo pe teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sukoth khaw hotute chuan, “Zeba leh Zalmuna chu in kuta awm em an nih a, i sipai chaute ei tûr kan han pêk na tûr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “ Lalpan Zeba leh Zalmuna ka kuta mi pêk hun chuan thlalêra hlîng leh râlsamkuaiin in vun ka kai thlêr vek ang maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Penuel-ah an kal a, an hnênah chuan Sukoth mite a tih ang bawk khân a ti a; anni pawh chuan an chhân ang bawk khân an lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Penuel-a mite hnênah pawh chuan, “Ralmuanga ka lo kîr leh hun chuan in khua hi ka tichim ngei ang maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zeba leh Zalmuna chu Karkor khuaah, an sipaite nên an awm a. Thlalêra chêngho chu mi nuaikhat leh sînghnih indonaah an thi tawh a, a thi bâng mi sîngkhat leh sângnga lai chuan an la zui zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gideona chu Noba leh Zogbeha chhak lam thingtlâng kawngah a kal a, hmêlma inring lo chu a bei thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midian lal Zeba leh Zalmuna chu an tlân bo va; mahse, an ûm a, an man a; an sipaite chu an buai ta nuai nuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An inbeih zawh chuan Gideona chu Heres kalkhân lamah a lo haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sukoth tlangvâl pakhat hi a man a, an khaw hotute leh upate hming a zâwt a, tichuan Sukkoth khuaa mi lianhote leh upate hming chu a ziaksak vek a, sawmsarih pasarih an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sukoth a thlen chuan an hnênah, “Zeba leh Zalmuna hi en teh u, ‘Zeba leh Zalmuna chu in kuta awm em an niha i sipai chaute ei tûr kan han pêk na tûr’ tia min tihel vei kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlalêr hlîng leh râlsamkuai a la a, khaw hotute chu a man a, Sukoth mite hmaah hlîng chuan a hrût ta nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Penuel kulh bangte chu a tichim bawk a, a chhûnga mite chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gideona chuan Zeba leh Zalmuna chu, “Tabor tlânga in mi thahte mi eng ang nge an nih?” tiin a zâwt a. Anni chuan, “An ang khawp mai che, lal fa ni âwm tak an ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka unau, ka nu hrin ve te ngei an nih chu. Lalpa hming chhâlin ka sawi hi, zuah ula chuan nangni pawh ka that lo tûr che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A fapa upa ber Jethera hnênah, “Tho la, that teh,” a ti a. Mahse, khandaih chu a phawi lo, a that ngam lo a ni, a la naupang êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zeba leh Zalmuna chuan, “Nangmah kha lo tho la, pa leh pa inbeih tûr alâwm,” an ti a. Gideona chu a tho va, Zeba leh Zalmuna chu a that a, an sanghâwngsei nghâwngawrh pawh a lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Gideona hnênah, “Midian-ho lakah min chhanhim a, kan chunga rorêltuah ṭang rawh, i fate, i tute pawh ṭang zêl rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gideona chuan, “In chunga rorêltuah ka ṭang lo vang; ka fate pawh an ṭang lo vang. In chunga rorêltu tûr chu Lalpa a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gideona chuan an hnênah, “Mi tinin râl bengbeh in lâk kha pakhat min pe ṭheuh ula ka va ti êm!” a ti a. Râlte chu Ismael mi an nih avângin rangkachak bengbeh an lâksak ṭeuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kan ui hauh lo, kan pe ang che,” an ti a. Puan an phah a, râl bengbeh an lâk chu an pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutianga an pêk khâwm rangkachak bengbeh chu kg. sawmhnih dâwn lai a ni. Midian lalho incheina, ṭhi te, puan senduk te leh an sanghâwngsei nghâwngawrh a neih te chu chûng zîngah chuan chhiar tel a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gideona chuan chûng chuan Efod a siam a, a awmna khua Ofra-ah a dah a. Israel-te chuan an pên bo phah a, Gideona leh a chhûngte tân thang hlauhawm tak a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midian-ho chu Israel-te chuan an tudawl a, a inlek leh ngai tawh lo. Gideona dam chhûng zawng kum 40 chhûng ram chu a râlmuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gideona, Zerubaala an tih bawk chu, ama inah a haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gideona chuan nupui a ngah hle a; fapa sawmsarih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sekem khuaa a hmei chuan fapa a hrinsak bawk a, a hmingah Abimeleka a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joasa fapa Gideona chu a tar hle hnu chuan a thi a, Abiezer mite ram Ofra khuaah, a pa Joasa thlânah an phûm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gideona chu a thi ta chauh tihin Israel mite chu Baal lamah an pêng leh a, Baal-berith chu pathianah an neih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kil tina an hmêlmate kut ata chhanchhuaktu Lalpa , an Pathian chu Israel-te chuan an hre reng duh lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gideonan Israel-te a khawngaih ṭhîn ang khân anni chuan Gideona chhûngte chu an khawngaih ve duh lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gideona fapa, Abimeleka chu Sekem khuaa a nu inah chuan a kal a, a nu chhûngte leh a nu pa chhûngte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sekem mite hian, ‘Gideona fa sawmsarihten in chungah rorêl se nge in tih pakhat chauhvin, sawi rawh u,’ in ti dâwn nia; kei hi a fate zînga in thisen zawmpui awm chhun ka nih hi hre reng bawk ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nu nuṭate chuan Sekem mite hnênah chûng thu chu an hrilh a, Abimeleka hnung zui chu an châk ta a, “Kan unaupa a ni tak alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Baal-berith an biakna in ata tangkaraw tlang sekel sawmsarih an pe a. A ṭhuihruai atân mi bengtlalo leh pâwngpawrh tak tak chu Abimeleka chuan tangka chuan a ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pa chhûngte awmna Ofra khuaah chuan a va kal a, Gideona fa sawmsarihte chu lung pakhat chungah a that a; an naupang ber Jothama erawh chu a biru a, a that ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sekem mi leh Beth-milo mi zawng zawng chu an pung khâwm a, Sekem bula sasaw thing hnuaiah Abimeleka chu lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu chu Jothama an hrilh a, Gerizim tlângchhîpah chuan a kal a, theihtâwpin a au va, heti hian a ti a, “Sekem mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla teh u; tichuan, Pathian pawhin in thu a ngaithla dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawi khat chu lal thlan tumin thing zawng zawng an pung khâwm a, Oliv thing hnênah ‘Kan lalah ṭang ta che’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oliv thing chuan, ‘In lal ka niha, ka tei ka tei chuan ka hriak, Pathian leh mihring chawimawi nâna an hman ṭhin chu, ka nei thei tawh lo vang asin,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Theipui hnênah, ‘A nih, nang lo kal la, kan lalah lo ṭang ta che,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, theipui chuan, ‘In lala ṭangin tei tei ila, thlum tak tak leh tui tak takin ka rah hman hlei ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grep hrui hnênah an kal a, ‘Nang tal lo kal la, kan lalah lo ṭang rawh,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Grep hrui chuan, ‘In lalah ṭangin tei tei ila, Pathian leh mihring tilâwmtu uaina sâwr tûr grep rah ka nei hman nâng,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thing zawng zawng chu hmupa hnênah an kal a, ‘Nang hi zawng kan lalah i ṭang ngei tûr a ni,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmupa chuan, ‘Lala min duh tak meuh chuan ka buk hnuaiah lo kal rawh u; in lo kal loh chuan ka ṭang hlîng ata mei a lo chhuak ang a, Lebanon sidarte lam a kang fai ang,’ a ti a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jothama chuan a sawi zêl a, “Abimeleka lala in siam hi duh tak meuhva ti em in nih? Gideona chu ngaisângin a phu ang ngeiin a chhûngte pawh tihtakmeuhvin in chawimawi duh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pa, Gideona chuan Midian-ho lakah a chhan chhuak che u a, thih huamin a ṭang a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, ka pa chhûngte chungah in inlek a, a fapa sawmsarih chu lung pakhat chungah in that a, a chhiahhlawhnu fapa, in chipui fa a nih avângin lalah in siam tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gideona leh a chhûngte chunga thil dik tak ti nia in inhriat chuan Abimeleka chu lâwm takin zui ula, ani pawhin lâwm takin ho che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang a nih loh chuan Abimeleka aṭangin mei lo chhuak sela, Sekem leh Beth-milo khua chu kâng rawh se. Sekem leh Beth-milo kâng chuan Abimeleka chu kâng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A unaupa Abimeleka chu a hlauh avângin Jothama chu a tlân bo va, Beer khuaah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abimelekan Israel-te chu kum thum a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abimeleka leh Sekem mite chu Pathianin a inhuattîr a, Sekem mite chuan Abimeleka chu vervêk takin an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gideona fa sawmsarih râwng taka a thah avângin an thisen mawh chu Abimeleka leh amah thlâwptu Sekem mite chungah chuan a tla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sekem mite chuan tlângah, rawlrâlin Abimeleka chângtute an dah a, chûng mite chuan lo kal apiang an lo rawk ṭhîn. Chu chu Abimeleka an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ebeda fapa Gaala chu a unaute nên Sekem-ah an lo kal a; Sekem mite chuan an lo ring hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lovah te an kal a, grep rah te an lo va, kût an hmang a, an pathian inah an lût a, an eiin an in a, Abimeleka chu ânchhia an lawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebeda fapa Gaala chuan, “Sekem mite hian eng nge maw an hriata Abimeleka rawng an bâwl le? Gideona fapa kha a ni lâwm ni? Zebula lah hi a thu thu-a awm a ni si a. In pu Hamora thlahte rawng bâwl ta zâwk che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hruaitu che u ni ila chu Abimeleka hi ka hnawt bo ngei ang; ‘Abimelek, sipai lâk belh la, lo chhuak rawh, inbei ang’ ka ti ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khaw hotu Zebula chuan Ebeda fapa Gaala thu sawi a hriat chuan a thinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Abimeleka hnênah a rûk têin Aruma-ah zualko a tîr a, “Sekem-ah Ebeda fapa Gaala leh a unaute an lo kal a, khuaa mite hi i lakah an tihel zo dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, a zân a zânin lo kal la, i hote kha han hruai la, daiah châng ru ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zîng takah in tho ang a, khawpui chu rawn ṭhâwng thut ula; bei tûr che ua a mite nêna an lo chhuak chu duh tâwkin in lo ching dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abimeleka chu a hote nên a zân a zânin an thawk chhuak a, Sekem khua chu hmun li-ah an châng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ebeda fapa Gaala chu a lo chhuak a, kulh kawngkaah chuan a ding a. Abimeleka leh a hote chu an bihrûkna aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Anni chu Ebeda fapa Gaala chuan a han hmuhin Zebula hnênah, “Tlâng aṭangin, saw, mi an lo kal chhuk ka ti,” a ti a. Zebula chuan, “Tlâng hlim saw mi emaw tiin i hmusual a ni ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gaala chuan, “En mah teh, tlâng bula saw! Mi an lo chhuk ngei alâwm, pâwl khat dang pawh Meonenim lam aṭangin an lo kal saw!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zebula chuan heti hian a ti ta a, “Abimeleka hi tu nge maw a nih a a rawng kan bâwlna tûr!’ i tihna hmui kha khawiah nge a awm tâk? I hmuhsit êm êmte kha an nih saw. Chhuak la, va bei ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Gaala chuan Sekem mite chu a hruai chhuak a, Abimeleka chu a bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan a ûm a, a tlânchhe ta a. Kulh kawngka bul thlengin hliam tam tak an tlu phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Abimeleka chu Aruma khuaa awm a ni a. Zebula chuan Gaala leh a unaute chu Sekem aṭang chuan a hnawt chhuak a, an awm thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A tûk chuan Abimelekan Gaala leh a unaute chu Sekem khaw pâwnah an tlân chhuak dâwn tih a hriatin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a mite chu a hruai a, pâwl thumah a ṭhen a, pâwnah chuan a lo châng a. Mite chu an lo chhuak a, a tho va, a bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Abimeleka leh a hote chu kulh kawngka bulah an tlân a, a ṭhiante pâwl hnih chuan pâwna chhuak tawhte chu an bei zui a, an that phiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Abimeleka chuan khua chu nilêngin a bei a, a la ta a. A chhûnga mite chu a that a, khua chu a tichhia a, chi a phul chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Sekem khuaa hotu lian deuh deuhte chu Baal-berith biakna in kulhbîngah chuan an tlân khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khaw hotu deuh deuh an tlân khâwm thu chu Abimelekan a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Zalmon tlângah chuan Abimeleka chu a chho va, a hote zawng zawng chuan an zui a. Abimeleka chuan hreipui a la a, thing ṭang a chêk thla a, a pu chho va; a hote hnênah chuan, “Ka tih ang hian han ti ve sawk sawk teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A hote zawng zawng chuan thing ṭang an thlâk ṭheuh va, Abimeleka tih angin kulhbîngah chuan an dah zêl a, kulhbîng chu a hâl hnan ta a; khaw hotu deuh deuhte pawh chu an thi ve ta vek a, mipa leh hmeichhia sângkhat lai an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Abimeleka chu Thebes khuaah a kal a: a hual a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khuaah chuan in sâng pakhat, rinawm tak hi a awm a. Chutah chuan mi zawng zawng, a hmei a pa, khaw hotute nên an tlân khâwm a, an inkalhkhum tlat a. In sâng chhîp zâwlah chuan an chho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Abimeleka chu in sâng bulah chuan a lo kal a, kawngka chu hâl tumin a va hnaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nu pakhat hian buh râwtna lung chungnung zâwk hi a lu-ah a zu thlâk a, a luruh chu a tlâk keh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tlangvâl, a râlthuam kengtu chu a han ko thuai a, “I khandaih kha phawi la, min that rawh, hmeichhe tihhlum min ti khanglâng dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tlangvâl chuan a chhun hlum ta a. Israel mite chuan Abimeleka a thi ta tih an hriat chuan mahni in lamah an haw ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chutiang chu a pa leh a unau sawmsarih chunga a thil sual tih avângin Pathianin a tuartîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Sekem mite pawh an thil sual tih avângin Pathianin a tuartîr a, Gideona fapa Jothama ânchhia chu an chungah a tla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abimeleka a thih hnu chuan Isakara thlah zînga mi Pua fapa Tola, Dodoa tupa, Efraim tlângram Samir khuaa awm chu Israel-te chhan chhuak tûrin a lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pathum chhûng Israel-te chu a ho va, a thi a, Samir khuaah chuan an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tola thih hnuah Gilead mi Jaira a lo awm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel-te chu kum sawmhnih leh pahnih a ho va. Fapa sawmthum a nei a, chûngte chuan chuanna tûr sabengtung an nei ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead ramah chuan khawpui sawmthum an nei a, chung khaw hming chu ‘Jair khua’ tih a ni vek a. Jaira chu a thi a, a awmna Kamon-ah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti leh a; Baal te, Astarte te, Aram-ho pathian te, Zidon-ho pathian te, Moab-ho pathian te, Amon-ho pathian te, Filistia-ho pathian te an be ve a. Lalpa chu an hawisan a, a rawng an bâwl duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu Israel chungah a thinur hle a, Filistia-ho leh Amon-ho kutah a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amon-ho chuan kum sâwm leh pariat chhûng chu Jordan chhak lama Amor-ho ram Gilead-a Israel awmte chu an tiduhdah a, an tirethei êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amon-ho chuan Jordan lui kânin Juda thlah te, Benjamin-ho te leh Efraim-ho te chu an bei a, an timangang êm êm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-ho chuan Lalpa an au va, “Kan Pathian kan hawisan a, Baal rawng kan bâwl a, a chungah thil sual kan ti a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te hnênah, “Aigupta mi te, Amon mi te, Amor mi te, Filistia mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zidon mi te, Amalek mi te leh Maon mi te chuan an tiduhdah che u a, min au va, ka chhan chhuak che u a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin min hawisan a, pathian dang rawng min bâwlsan a; chuvângin, ka chhan chhuak tawh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In duh zâwk pathian dangte hnênah chuan kal rawh u; chhan chhuak tûr che uin ngên ta che u, in mangang hi rawn chhan che u rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Kan sual a ni: âwm i tih ang angin min ching mai rawh; hêngho lakah hian min chhan chhuak phawt mai teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian dang lim an kawlte chu an paih a, Lalpa chu chibai an bûk ta zâwk a; Israel-te retheihzia a hmuh chuan a lainat hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amon-ho chu an pung khâwm a, Gilead-ah bûk an khuar a, Israel-te pawh an pung khâwm a, Gilead biala Mizpa khuaah bûk an khuar ve bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite leh Gilead-a an hruaitute chuan, “Amon-ho bei tûrin tu nge hma hruai ang? Hma hruaitu chu Gilead ram hotu a ni ang” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead mi, Jeftha chu pa huai tak a ni a; a nu chu nawhchizuar a ni. Gileada fa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gileada nupui chuan fapa a hring ṭeuh va, chûngte chu an lo puitlin chuan Jeftha chu an hnawt chhuak a, ‘Kan pa ro chang ve tûr i ni lo, nu dang fa i nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeftha chu a unaute khua aṭang chuan a tlân chhuak a, Tob ramah a awm ta a. Jeftha chu mi ho tak takten an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amon-hovin Israel-te an rawn bei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead hruaitute chu Tob khuaa awm Jeftha chu hruai tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ti rawh, min ho la, Amon-hote kan han bei dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeftha chuan Gilead upate chu a chhâng a, “Min huat avângin in pa in ata min hnawt chhuak a, in mangan veleh engtizia nge min rawn pan leh si le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead upate chuan Jeftha chu an chhâng a, “Chuvâng chuan alâwm, Amon-ho beihnaa min ho tûra kan duh che, Gilead mite hi i ho dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jeftha chuan, “Amon-ho bei tûra min hruai kîra, Lalpan min hnehtîr chuan in hotu-ah ka ṭang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilead upate chuan, “I duh ang chuan kan ti ang, Lalpa chu kan thuhretu a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Jeftha chuan Gilead upate chu a zui a, mite chuan an hotu-ah leh hruaituah an siam ta a, Jeftha chuan a thil phût chu Mizpa khuaah chuan Lalpa hmaah a puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeftha chuan Amon lal hnênah palai a tîr a, “Kan ram bei tûrin engtizia nge i rawn inrawlh le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amon lal chuan palaite hnênah “Aigupta ram ata Israel-te an lo chhuah khân ka ram min chhuhsak ṭeuh va, chuvâng alâwm. Arnon lui leh Jabok lui inkâr, Jordan ruam chu min lâksak a, hênga khuate hi sawi tam lovin min pe kîr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeftha chuan palaite chu Amon lal hnênah a tîr kîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Moab leh Amon ram Israel-ten an chhuhsak hlei nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga Israel-te an lo chhuah khân thlalêra kal tlangin Tuipui Senah an kal a, Kades an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom lal hnênah, ‘I ramah kan lo kal tlang ang e,’ tia an dîl khân a lo phal lo va. Chutiang bawkin Moab lal pawh an dîl a, a phal lo va; Israel-te chu Kades-ah chuan an châm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Edom kal tlang lovin thlalêrah a kual zawngin an kal a, Moab ram pawh an hêl a, Moab khawchhak lamah an kual a; Moab ram lût lovin an ramri lui Arnon phai, an ram lo lamah, bûk an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-te chuan Amor mi, Hesbon lal Sihona hnênah pawh, ‘Kan rama kal tûrin i ramah kan lo kal tlang ang e,’ tia an dîl chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sihona chuan a phal lo va, a mite a ko khâwm a, Jahaz-ah bûk a khuar a, Israel-te chu a bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian Lalpa chuan Sihona leh a mite chu Israel-te kutah a pe a, an that a; chu lai rama Amor mite awmna chu an nei ta vêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Amor-ho ram, Arnon lui leh Jabok lui inkâr, thlalêr leh Jordan lui inkâr ram chu an nei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin Amor mite a pêk chu nangin neihsak i tum em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I pathian Khemosa ram pêk che chu nei mai la, kan Pathian Lalpa min pêk chin ram chu keinin kan nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab lal Zipora fapa Balaka ai khân chakin i inhria em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kum zathum zet chu Israel-te hian Hesbon khawpui leh Aroer khawpui hi, an chhehvêl khuate nên, Arnon lui kam khawpui zawng zawng nên hian an lo luah tawh a, chumi chhûng zawng chuan chhuhsak rêng i tum ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, keinin tihsual kan nei hlei nem, nangin mi rawn bei mai hi i ti dik lo zâwk a ni. Lalpa , Rorêltu chuan, Israel mite leh Amon mite inkâr thu hi rel fel mai teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amon lal chuan Jeftha thu chu a ngaithla duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chu Jeftha chungah a lo thleng a, Gilead leh Manasea ram chu a fang a, Gilead bial Mizpa khuaah chuan a lo kîr leh a. Amon-ho ramah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jeftha chu Lalpa hmaah a inṭawng tiam a, “Amon mite hi mi hnehtîr phawt chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />in aṭanga râl ram kan haw min hmuak tûra lo chhuak hmasa ber chu tu pawh ni se, Lalpa tâna serh hran tlat a ni ang a, hâlral thilhlanah ka hmang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeftha chu Amon mite ramah chuan a kal ta a; a va bei a, Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aroer khua aṭanga Minit bial khaw sawmhnih, Abel-Keramim thlengin a la kîr a, a that ṭeuh va. Israel mite hmaah chuan Amon-ho chu an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jeftha chu Mizpa khuaa a inah a lo haw a. Ngai teh, amah hmuak tûrin a fanu chu benchhek nên a lo lâm chhuak a. Ani chu a fa neihchhun a ni; mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw fa dang rêng a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A fanu a han hmuh chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a, “A va pawi em! Ka fanu, nang ber kher chu! Ka lung i tichhiain min va timangang tak êm! Lalpa hnênah ṭawng ka lo thlah tawh a, sût leh rual a ni si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka pa, Lalpa hmaa ṭawng i thlah tawh si chuan i thu ang chuan ti rawh; Lalpa chuan i hmêlma Amon-ho chungah phuba a la tawh alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pa hnênah chuan, “Heti hian i ti ang; thla hnih chhûng chu min thlah fâl la, ka ṭhiante nên tlângah te kan kal ang a, nulât laia ka thi mai tûr hi ka sûn ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kaltîr a, thla hnih chhûng chu a thang botîr a. A ṭhiante nên chuan tlângah an kal a, fa nei lova a thi tûr chu an sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thla hnih hnu chuan a pa hnênah a lo haw a, Lalpa hnêna a thutiam chu a hlen ta a; nula thianghlimin a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel-te zîngah, Israel nulate chuan, kum tin Gilead mi Jeftha fanu sûn tûrin ni li an thang bo ṭhîn, dânah an neih ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim-ho chu an inpun khâwm a, Jordan ral Zafon-ah an kai phei a. Jeftha hnênah, “Amon mite bei tûrin ramri i pêl a, engtizia nge tel ve tûra min sâwm loh? I in kan hâlsak ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeftha chuan, “Amon mite leh kan mite hi kan inhal hle a ni. Min ṭanpui tûrin ka sâwm che u a, min rawn chhan duh lo a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi pui dâwn lo tih ka hriatin thih dâwn lovin ramri ka kân ta a; kan va bei a, Lalpa chuan min hnehtîr ta a ni. Chuvângin, min bei tûrin engtizia nge in lo thawh mai le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeftha chuan Gilead mite chu a ko khâwm a, Efraim-ho chu a bei a, a hneh ta a. Efraim-ho chuan, “Nangni Gilead-ho hi Efraim leh Manasea ram aṭanga dawihzepho tlân khâwm in ni’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead-ho chuan Jordan dai kai theihna lai apiang an luah a, Efraim mi, tlânchhia tawh phawtin dai kai rawn dîl apiangte chu Gilead-ho chuan, “Efraim mi i ni em?” an lo ti zêl a. “Ni lo ve,” a tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Shibolet han ti teh,” an ti a; a lam fiah theih lohva, ‘Sibolet’ a tih chuan an man a, Jordan lui kaiah chuan an that mai ṭhîn. Chumi nia Efraim mi thi zawng zawng chu sîngli leh sânghnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeftha chuan Israel-te chu kum ruk a ho va, a thi a, Gilead-a a awmna khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jeftha hnuah Bethlehem khaw mi Ibzana chuan Israel-te chu a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fapa sawmthum leh fanu sawmthum a nei a. A fanu sawmthumte chu a chipui ni lo khaw dang mi pasal a neihtîr a; a fapa sawmthumte pawh a chipui ni lo nupuiah a neihsak a. Ibzana chuan Israel-te chu kum riat a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thi a, Bethlehem-ah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ibzana hnu chuan Zebulun mi Elona chuan Israel-te chu kum sâwm a ho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thi a, Zebulun ram Aijalon khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elona hnu chuan Pirathon khaw mi Hilela fapa Abdona chuan Israel-te chu a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fapa sawmli leh tupa sawmthum a nei a, an chuanna ṭheuh tûr sabengtung sawmsarih a nei a. Abdona chuan Israel-te chu kum riat a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thi a, Efraim ram, Amalek-ho awmna tlângram Pirathon khuaah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Lalpa ngaihmawhzâwng thil sual an ti leh a, kum sawmli chhûng chu Filistia hnuaiah Lalpa chuan a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zora khuaah Dana thlah, mi pakhat, Manoa a awm a; a nupui chu a ching a, fa rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmeichhe hnênah chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh a inlâr a, “Ngai teh, fa nei thei lovin i ching na a, nau i pai ang a, fapa i hring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, fîmkhur la, uain emaw, zu emaw in suh la, sa thiang lo pawh ei hauh suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I nau pai, fapa i hrin tûr chu, a lu ziah kawlh bawk loh tûr a ni. Pathian tân a pian aṭangin Nazarit mi a ni ang. Ani chuan Filistia mite lakah Israel-te chhan chhuah hna a thawk ṭan ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu a kal a, a pasal hnênah, “Pathian mi ka hnênah a lo kal a, Lalpa vântirhkoh hmêl pu a ni, a hlauhawm khawp mai. Khawi lam mi nge a nih ka zâwt lo va, a hming pawh min hrilh hek lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, nau i pai ang a, fapa i hring dawn, uain emaw, zu emaw in hauh suh, sa thiang lo pawh ei rêng rêng suh, i nau hrin chu a pian aṭanga a thih thlengin Pathian tân Nazarit mi a ni ang,’ tiin min hrilh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manoa chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Aw Lalpa , Pathian, mi i rawn tirh kha lo kal leh sela, nau lo piang tûr chu engtin nge kan enkawl ang, min zirtîr teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian chuan Manoa dilna chu a ngaithla a, lova a ṭhut laiin hmeichhe hnênah Pathian vântirhkoh chu a rawn inlâr leh a, a pasal Manoa chu a awm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmanhmawh takin hmeichhia chu a pasal hnênah a tlân a, “Hmân ni-a lo kal ka sawi kha a lo kal leh ta e,” a va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manoa chu a tho va, a nupui chu a zui a, mi chu an va hmu a, “Hmeichhe hnêna thusawitu kha i ni em?” a ti a. “Ni e” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Manoa chuan, “I thu anga thil a lo thlen hunah nau chu engtia enkawl tûr nge ni anga, eng angin nge a khawsak ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan, “Hmeichhe hnêna ka hrilh ang khân awm sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />grep kûng aṭangin thil eng mah a ei tûr a ni lo, uain emaw, zu emaw in hek suh se. Ka hrilh zawng zawng kha zâwm sela, thil thiang lo pawh ei suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Manoa chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh hnênah, “Kan han chelh lawk teh ang che, kêltê kan han talh ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan, “Min chelh mah ula in chaw chu ka ei lo vang, hâlral thilhlan i hlân dâwn a nih chuan Lalpa tân hlân ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manoa chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh hnênah, “I thu anga thil a lo thlen hunah kan chawimawi theih nân che i hming min hrilh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan, “Engah nge ka hming mi zawh, sawi mi a ni hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Manoa chuan kêltê chu a talh a, buhbâl thilhlan nên hâlral thilhlanah lungpui chungah chuan Lalpa tân a hlân ta a. Thil mak tak lo awm ta chu Manoa te nupa chuan an en reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungpui maichâm aṭanga mei khu vân lama a han chhoh chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh chu meiah chuan vânah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manoa te nupa chuan chu mi chu Lalpa vântirhkoh a ni tih an hre ta a; hmai lei siin an kûn ta a. Vântirhkoh chu an hmu leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Manoa hnênah emaw, a nupui hnênah emaw Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a inlâr leh tawh lo. Manoa chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh ngei a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manoa chuan a nupui hnênah, “Pathian kan hmu a, kan thi ngei dâwn a nih hi,” a ti a. A nupui erawh chuan, “ Lalpa chuan min tihlum duh ni se kan hâlral thilhlan leh buhbâl thilhlan kha a pawm lo vang a, hêng thil hi min hrilh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan fapa a hring a, a hmingah Samsona a sa a; nau chu a lo ṭhang lian a, Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chuan Zora leh Estaol inkâr Mahane-dan-ah Samsona chu a rawn pâwl ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samsona chu Timna khuaah a zu chhuk a, Timna khuaa Filistia nula pakhat chu a zu hmu a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A haw chho va, a nu leh a pa hnênah, “Timna khuaah Filistia nula pakhat ka hmu a, nupuiah min neihsak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nu leh a pa chuan, “Kan chipuite zîngah emaw, kan mite zîngah emaw nupui tûr an awm lo em ni? Engtizia nge serh tan loh Filistia-ho fa nupuia neih i duh tâk?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samsona chuan, “Min neihsak mai teh u, hmêlṭha ka tihzâwng tak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistia mite chunga chêtna tûr remchâng zawngin Lalpa chuan Samsona chu a hmang a ni tih a nu leh pa chuan an hre lo. Chutih lai chuan Filistia-ho chu Israel-te chunga rorêltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A nu leh pa hruaiin Samsona chu Timna khuaah chuan a zu chhuk a. Timna-ho grep huan an thleng a, sakeibaknei tuai hian a lo rûm khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chuan a rawn man thut a, eng mah ken a nei lo na a, kêltê ang lekin a lo pawt sawm vêk a, a nu leh pa pawh a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuaah chuan a kal a, nula chuan a tilâwm hle a. Hun eng emawti hnuah chuan hruai tumin a chhuk leh a, sakeibaknei ruang kha en tûrin a pêng zawk a, khuai an lo awm mur mur a, a zu pawh a tam hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuai chu a la a, kal pahin a ei zêl a, a nu leh pa pawh a pe a, an ei a; sakeibaknei ruang aṭanga a lâk a ni tih a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pa chu nula inah chuan a zu lêng a; tlangvâlho tih ṭhin dân angin Samsona chuan ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistia-ho chuan a ṭhianah tlangvâl sawmthum an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Samsona chuan an hnênah, “Thu khirh ka han hrilh ang che u, ruai ṭheh chhûng ni sariha a awmzia in hriat chuan puan zai sîn sawmthum, inthlâkna tûr nên, ka pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In hriat loh erawh chuan puan zai sîn sawmthum leh inthlâkna tûr sawmthum min pe a ni ang chu,” a ti a. “I thu khirh chu han sawi la, kan lo ngaithla ang chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Eitu aṭangin ei tûr a lo awm a, Chak tak aṭangin thil thlum a lo chhuak,’ tih hi,” a ti a. Ni thum an ngaihtuah pawhin a awmzia an hre thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni sarih ni chuan Samsona nupui hnênah an kal a, “I pasal chu a thu khirh hrilh tûr chein ngên rawh; chutilo chu, nang leh i chhûngte hi kan hâl hlum ang che u. Min tikawnkâw tûrin em ni ṭhianah min sâwm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samsona nupui chu a hmaah a ṭap a, “Min lo hmangaih tawp lo va, min haw zâwk a nih hi; kan mi, tlangvâlte thu khirh i zâwt a, a awmzia pawh min hrilh duh si lo,” a ti a. A hnênah chuan, “Ka nu leh pa pawh ka hrilh lo va, nang ka hrilh ang che maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ruai an ṭheh chhûng ni sarih chhûng chu a ṭap a ṭap a; a ngen tlut tlut avâng chuan a ni sarih ni chuan a hrilh ta nge nge a. A nupui chuan a mite chu a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu khaw tlangvâlte chu a ni sarih ni, ni tlâk hmain a hnênah an lo kal a, “Khawizu aia thlum eng nge awm? Sakeibaknei aia chak zâwk eng nge ni?” an ti a. Samsona chuan, “Ka bâwngla hi lei rîtah chhawr lo ula chu Ka thu khirh in hre hauh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chuan a rawn man thut a. Askelon-ah a chhuk a, mi sawmthum a zu that a, an thawmhnaw chu a lâksak a; a thu khirh hretute kha inthlâkna puante chu a pe a. A thinur hle a, a pa inah a haw chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samsona nupui chu a ṭhian pakhat kha an lo neihtîr ta mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nakin deuhah chuan huit seng hun laiin Samsona chuan kêltê kengin a nupui chu a zu tlawh dâwn a, “Ka nupui pindanah ka va lût ang e,” a ti a; mahse, a puzawn chuan a phal lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I duh ta hauh lo a nih hi kan ti a, i ṭhian pakhat kha kan lo neihtîr ta asin. A nau hi a hmêl a ṭha zâwk a, khawngaih takin a aiah nei mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samsona chuan, “Tûn ṭum chu Filistia mite pawi khawih mah ila, dem theih ka ni lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samsona chu a chhuak a, sihal zathum a man a, pahnih zêl mei a ṭawn zawm a, a ṭawn zawmnaah chuan meichher a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meichher chu a chhi a, Filistia-ho lova huit hmunah chuan sihalte chu a chhuah a. Huit phal leh a ding lai chu a kâng ta duai duai a, oliv hmunte pawh a kâng tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan, “Tu tih nge?” an ti a. “Timna khaw mi mâkpa Samsona tih alâwm. A nupui a lâksak a, a ṭhianpa a pe vei a nih kha,” an ti a. Filistia-ho chu an lo kal a, chu hmeichhia leh a pa chu an hâl hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samsona chuan, “Hetianga in tih chuan in chungah ka ṭuan zet ang a, ka ti tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an chungah a che ta chiam a, a that ṭeuh va, Etam khâm pûkah a chhuk a, a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Filistia mite chu an chho va, Judai ramah bûk an khuar a, Lehi hmunah an inzâr darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judai ram mite chuan, “Engtizia nge min bei tûra in lo chhoh mai le?” an ti a. Anni chuan, “Samsona phuara, min sawisak anga sawisa ve tûrin kan lo thawk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judai ram mi sângthum Etam khâm pûkah chuan an chhuk a, Samsona hnênah, “Filistia-ho hi kan chunga thuneitute an ni tih i hre na nge? Kan chunga i thiltih hi engtizia nge ni ta ngai?” an ti a. “Min tih angin an chungah ka han ti ve a nih kha,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Filistia mite pêk atân kan rawn phuar dâwn che a ni,” an ti a. Samsona chuan, “Nangmahniin ka chunga kut thlâk loh tiam phawt rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hnênah chuan, “Ni e, kan phuar ang che a, an kutah kan pe ang che, kan that tawp lo vang che,” an ti a. Hruizên thar pahnihin an phuar a, pûk ata chu an rawn hruai chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lehi an lo thlen chuan Filistia-ho chuan an lo hmuak a, an au dur dur a; Lalpa thlarau chuan a rawn man thut a, an phuarna hrui chu la zai kâng ang maiin a chat hmek hmek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabengtung khaberuh tharlâm tak hi a hmu a, a la a, mi sângkhat zet a vaw hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samsona chuan, “Sabengtung khaberuh maiin ka talh vûm thûr a, A sâng têl ka vaw hlum, Sabengtung khaberuh rovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutia a sawi zawh chuan sabengtung khaberuh chu a paih a, chu hmun chu Ramat-lehi an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tui a hâl êm êm a, Lalpa chu a au va, “I chhiahhlawh hi ropui takin min hnehtîr a, tuihâlin ka thi mai dâwn alâwm, serh tan lohhovin min rawn that mai ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lehi hmuna khuar awm chu Lalpa chuan a tikhi a, tui a lo chhuak a; a han in chuan a chau chu a reh a, a harh ta huai a. Chu tuikhur chu En-hakore an vuah a, Lehi-ah chuan tûn thlengin a la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Filistia-ho vânglaiin Samsona chuan Israel mite chu kum sawmhnih a ho va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samsona chu Gaza khuaah a kal a, nawhchizuar a hmu a, a mutpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gaza khaw hotute chuan Samsona a lo kal tih an hriat chuan an hual a, “Khawvâr hunah aw kan thah ang,” an ti a; ngawi ṭhapin kulh kawngka bulah an châng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samsona chu zanlai thleng chauhvin a awm a; zânlaiah chuan a tho va, khawpui kulh kawngka chu a vuan a, a ban chawpin a pawt phawng a, a kalhnate nên lam a pu a, Hebron tlâng ep chhîpah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Sorek ruama awm nula pakhat, Delili chu a ngaizâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistia hotute chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Eng vânga heti taka chak nge a niha, engtin nge kan hneh theih ang hriat tum teh; kan phuar ang a, kan ching nek dâwn nia. Tangka sângkhat leh za ṭheuh kan pe ang che,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Delili chuan Samsona hnênah, “Eng vânga heti taka chak nge maw i nih min hrilh teh; engtin nge phuar che ila, kan sawisak theih ang che?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samsona chuan a hnênah, “Thal hrui thar pasarih, la tihro lohvin min phuar sela, ka chau dêr ang a; mi dang ang mai ka ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistia hruaitute chuan thal hrui thar pasarih, la tihro loh Delili hnenah an rawn keng a, chung chuan Samsona chu a phuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pindan chhûngrilah châng rutu an awm a. A hnênah chuan, “Samson, tho teh, Filistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Thal hruite chu mei linga la zai deh chhum ang maiin a tichat ta a. A chak chhan chu an la hre ta chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Delili chuan Samsona hnênah, “Min va han thamlo ve, dâwt min han hrilh le; engin nge maw phuar beh theih i nih ang, min hrilh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hruizên thar, la hman hlek lohvin min phuar sela, ka khawng reng mai ang, mi dang ang mai bawk ka ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Delili chuan hruizên thar la hman hlek loh chu a la a, a phuar a, “Samson, Filistia miten an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Chângtute chu pindan chhûngrilah an awm a, an lo chhuak a. La zai ang maiin hruizên pawh chu a tichat ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Delili chuan, “Min lo thamlo hle zawng a nih hi, dâwt bawk min hrilh leh ta. Engti takin nge maw phuar che ila i chak theih loh vang le?” a ti a. Samsona chuan, “Ka sam phiar sarih hi puanah tah hnan la, kilh bet tlat la, a ni mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sam chu a kilh bet a, a hnênah, “Samson, Filistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Ani chu a lo harh a, a tah hnanna puanbute chu a pawt phawng a, a sam chu a pawt dâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Delili chuan, “Vawi thum ngawt dâwt min hrilh a, chuti chungin engtin nge ka hmangaih che min la tih theih le? Min lo hmangaih tak tak loh hi, i chak chhan pawh min hrilh duh si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni tin a nawr a, a zawh tlut tlut avâng chuan a ning tawngkhawng chuan a hrilh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Engkim a hrilh ta a, “Ka pian tirh ata Pathian tâna Nazarit mi ka ni a, ka sam hi ziah kawlh a la ni lo. Ka lu hi meh ni sela ka chakna hi a bo vang a, mi dang ang bawkin ka chak lo ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Delili chuan engkim a hrilh ta tak tak a ni tih a hriat chuan Filistia hotute chu a ko va, “Lo chho thuai teh u, engkim min hrilh ta e,” a ti a. Filistia hotute chu an lo kal a, tangka chu an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mal chung lukhamin a muttîr a, mi pakhat a ko va, a sam phiar pasarih chu a hlehtîr a; a han beng harh a, a chakna chu a lo bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Samson, Filistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn che,” a ti a. A muhîl chu a lo harh a, “Tûn hma ang khân ka chak ang a, ka haw mai ang,” a ti a. Lalpa chuan a kalsan tih a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistia-ho chuan an man a, a mitmu an kherchhuahsak a. Gaza khuaah an hruai thla a, dâr kawl an buntîr a; tân inah chuan chhangphut an râwtdiptîr ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a lu an mehsak chu a lo hnim leh ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Filistia hotute chu an pathian Dagona hnênah thilhlan tam tak hlân tûrin an lo pung khâwm chiam a, “Kan hmêlma Samsona chu kan pathianin min mansak ta,” tiin an lâwm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samsona an hmuh chuan an pathian an fak a, “Min that ṭeuh va, kan ram tichhetu kha pathian chuan min mansak ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An hlim hle a, “Samsona kha han hruai teh u, nuihza siam nân i hmang ang u,” an ti a. Tân in aṭang chuan Samsona chu an la chhuak a, nuihza siam nân an hmang ta a, ban pahnih inkârah an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Samsona chuan a kaitu naupang hnênah chuan, “He in innghahna banpui ber hi min dehtîr hrâm teh, ka han nghêng teh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Inah chuan Filistia hruaitu, mipa leh hmeichhia an awm khat hmur a; a chhâwng chungah pawh chuan mipa leh hmeichhia sângthum lai an awm a. Samsona nuihza siam nâna an hmang chu an thlîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samsona chuan Lalpa a au va, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, min hre reng la, mi han tichak teh; aw Pathian, tûn ṭum chauh hi mi han tichak teh; ka mit khinghnih phuba hi Filistia mite chungah hian ka han la teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu in innghahna banpui pahnih chu a bân ding lam leh vei lamin a kuah a, a rinchhan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Filistia mite hi ka han thihchilh teh ang,” a ti a, ban chu theihtâwpin a nawr vak a, in chu a chim ta rup a, an hruaitute leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu a delh hlum ta a. A dam laia a thah ai chuan a thihchilhte chu an tam zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A unaute leh a pa chhûngte chu an lo chhuk a, a ruang chu an la chho va, a pa Manoa thlân Zora leh Estaol inkârah chuan an phûm ta a. Israel-te chu kum sawmhnih a ho a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim tlângramah mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Mika a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nu hnênah chuan, “Miin i tangkaraw tlang sângkhat leh za an rûksak che a, ânchhia i lawh a, kei pawh min hrilh kha, ka lâk a ni e, ka la kawl vek asin,” a ti a. A nu chuan, “E, ka fapa, Lalpa chuan mal sâwm che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangkaraw sângkhat leh za chu a nu a pe leh a, a nu chuan, “Ka ânchhia ka fapa chunga a tlâk loh nân keimah ngeiin hêng tangka hi Lalpa tân ka hlân a ni. Thing milem luan nân leh a chhûna chhûn milem siam nân hman tûr a ni. Tangkarua chu ka pe kîr leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nu a pêk kîr tangka chu a nu chuan tlang zahnih a la a, themthiam hnênah thing milem tangkaruaa luan tûr leh a chhûna chhûn tangkaraw milem siam nân a pe a; Mika inah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mika chuan pathian in a sa a, Efod leh milem a siam a, a fapa pakhat chu puithiam atân a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng hun lai chuan Israel ramah lal an nei lo, ṭha an tih ang angin mi tin an awm mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judai rama Bethlehem khuaah tlangvâl pakhat Levia chi hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu mi chuan awmna tûr zawngin Judai rama Bethlehem khua chu a chhuahsan a, Efraim tlângramah a lo kal a, Mika in chu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mika chuan, “Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Judai rama Bethlehem khuaa awm Levia chi ka ni a, awmna tûr zawngin ka lo kal a ni” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mika chuan a hnênah, “Ka hnênah awm ve mai la, ka pa leh puithiam atân ṭang ta mai che; kum khatah tangka tlang sâwm ka pe ang che, i silhfên sin khat leh ei pawh ka tum ang,” a ti a. Levia chi tlangvâl chu a awm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu mi inah chuan Levia chi chu lungawi takin a awm a, a fapa pakhat ang maiin a awm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mika chuan Levia chu a serh hrang a, tlangvâl chu a puithiamah a ṭantîr ta a; Mika inah chuan a chêng ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Levia chi ngei puithiamah ka nei ta a, Lalpa chuan min tiṭha ngei ang maw le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Israel ramah lal an nei lo. Israel zînga ram chanpual tûr an sem lai khân Dana thlahte chu ram chanpual tûr an ruatsak ve lo va, ram chanpual luah tûr an zawng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Dana thlahte chuan an chite zîng aṭangin mi panga fel tak tak, Zora leh Estaol khua aṭangin an thlang chhuak a, ram ṭha zawnga en thlithlai tûrin an tîr a. Efraim tlângram an han thlen chuan Mika inah an kal a, an riak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mika ina Levia chi tlangvâl ṭawng an han hriat chuan a aw phawi chu an hre ta a, an pan a, “Eng nge hetah i tih? Tu nge hruai che?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Mika inah ka lo kal a, puithiam atân min ruat a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kan kalna tûrah hian kan hmuingîl dâwn nge dâwn lo Pathian min râwnsak teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam chuan, “Ngaihngam takin kal rawh u, Lalpa chuan in kalna tûrah hian in hma a hruai e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi panga chu an kal a, Lais khua an va thleng a. Sidon mite ang bawkin chu khaw mite chu ngaihngam takin an awm tih an hmu a. Mi nunnêm, awm mai mai, tu mah tai nei lo, engkima intodelh an ni. Sidon khua aṭang chuan hla tak a ni a, mi dang hnêk hnai an nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi panga chu Zora leh Estaol khuaa mite hnên an thlen leh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ti rawh u, Lais khua chu i han bei ang u, a ram kan han hmu a, ram ṭha tak a ni. Hetah awm mai mai teh suh u; hmanhmawh ila, i han la ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Han thleng mah ila, an lo inrâlring lo vang. A ram pawh zau tâwk tak a ni; mihring mamawh engkim an hnianghnâr a ni; Lalpa chuan a pe tawh a che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Dana thlahte, hriamhrei keng mi zaruk chu Zora leh Estaol khua aṭang chuan an thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judai ramah an chho va, Kiriat-jearim-ah bûk an khuar a; chuvângin, chu khua chuan Mahane-dan tih hming a la pu ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An kal zêl a, Efraim tlângram Mika in chu an han thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lais leh a vêl ram han en thlithlaitu mi panga khân an ṭhiante hnênah, “Hêng in pakhat chhûngah hian thing milem tangkaruaa luante a awm tih in hria em? Milem dangte leh Efod pawh a awm, engtin nge ti ila ṭha ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levia chi tlangvâl awmna Mika inah chuan an kal a, chu tlangvâl chu, “I dam em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kawngkhâr bulah chuan hriamhrei kengin Dana thlahte chu mi zaruk an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi pangate kha erawh chu inah chuan an lût a, tangkaraw luan thing milem te, a chhûna chhûn milem te leh Efod te chu an la a; puithiam chu mi zaruk zîngah chuan an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi pangaten Mika ina thil serh awmte chu an lâk laiin puithiam chuan, “Engtin nge in tih dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ngawi mai rawh, ṭawng ve suh, kan hnênah lo kal zâwk la, kan puithiamah ṭang ang che, Israel hnam pum puithiam nih chu chhûng khat puithiam mai nih ai chuan i duh zâwk lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Puithiam chu a lâwm hle a; tichuan, thil serhte chu amah chuan a keng a, an zîngah chuan a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An lo kalna lamah an kîr a, an naupangte leh rante nên chuan an chhuak ta a; a kal hmasaten an bungruate chu an lo kalpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thui fe an kal tawh a, Mika chuan a ṭhenawm khawvêngte a pun a, bei tûrin a ûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dana thlahte chu an va ûm pha a, an au va. Dana thlahte chu an lo hawi a, Mika hnênah, “Eng nge ni ta, in va tam ve?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Eng nge ni ta te in han ti a; ka puithiam min chhuhsak a, pathian, ka siamte chu min rûksak a, eng mah hnutchhiah in nei hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dana thlahte chuan, “Thu dang eng mah sawi teh suh, hêng mite hi an thinur hlauh ang a, an bei mai ang che. In chhûngkuain an timang mai ang che u asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An kal ta zêl a, Mika chuan a aiin an chak zâwk hle tih a hriatin a kîr a, a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mika milem siam leh a puithiam chu an hruai a, Lais an va thleng a, ngaihngam taka an awm hle hle chu an bei a, khandaihin an sât hlum a, khua chu an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rawn chhan tûr tu mah an awm lo, Sidon khua aṭangin hla tak a ni a. Khua chu an din ṭha leh a, an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An thlahtu Dana, Israela fa hming chawiin chu khaw hmingah chuan Dan an sa a, a hming hmasa chu Lais a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dana thlahte chuan thing milem tangkaruaa luan chu an be ta a. Mosia fa Gersoma fapa Jonathana chu puithiamah an hmang a; chu mi thlahte chu saltân thleng khân Dan-ho puithiamah an ṭang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mika milem siamte chu a awm ta reng a. Inbiakna bûk, Pathian an biakna kha erawh chu Silo khuaah a awm.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel rama lal an neih hma khân Levia chi mi pakhat Efraim tlângram tâwpah a awm a, Judai ram Bethlehem khuaa mi hmei a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmei chuan a kalsan a, a pa in lamah, Judai ram Bethlehem khuaah chuan a haw a, thla li lai a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pasal chu a tho va, ṭawng ṭhaa thlêma hruai kîr leh tumin chhiahhlawh pakhat leh sabengtung pahnih nên a va kal a. Hmeichhia chuan a pa inah a hruai lût a; hmeichhe pa chu a lâwm hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmeichhe pa, a puzawn chuan a chelh a; ni thum chu an eiin an in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni li ni chuan zîngah an tho va; ani pawh chu chhuah tumin a tho va; mahse, a puzawn chuan, “Eng emaw tal ei zet ula, in chhuak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, an ṭhu ho va, an eiin an in ta a. A puzawn chuan, “Zânin chu riak leh mai rawh u, hmanhmawh tehchiam a ṭûl lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan chhuah an han tum leh a; mahse, a puzawn chuan a chelh leh a, an châm leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni nga ni chuan chhuak tawh tûrin zîng takah a tho va, a puzawn chuan, “Ni nêm deuh hma chu awm rih ula, eng emaw tal chu ei rih teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmei nên, a chhiahhlawh nên kal tûra an han thawh chhuah chuan a puzawn chuan, “Ngawi teh u, khua a va tlai ta ve, châm leh rih mai teh u; ni a tla dâwn mai tawh si a, hetah riak ula, chaw te i ei ho leh teh ang u. Naktûk zîngah in tho vang a, in khaw ban tûrin in chhuak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, châm leh chu a duh lo va, a tho va, a chhuak ta a. Jebus-ho khua Jerusalem khaw bul chu, a thawmhnaw phur sabengtungte nên chuan an thleng a, a hmei pawh chu a tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jebus-ho khua an thlen chuan ni a hniam hle tawh a, a chhiahhlawh chuan, “En teh, Jebus-ho khuaah hian i riak mai ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pu chuan, “Israel mi ni lo, hnam dang khuaah kan riak tûr a ni lo. Gibea khua i pan ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Gibea khuaah emaw, Rama khuaah emaw kan riak ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An kal ta zêl a Gibea khua an thlen chuan ni a tla ta a. Gibea chu Benjamin-ho khua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Riah tumin Gibea khua chu an pan a, thleng tûra lo sâwm tu mah an awm loh avângin khawpui tual laili chu an pan a, an ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlaiah putar pakhat feh haw hi a lo kal a; amah chu Efraim tlângram mi a ni a, Gibea khuaah a awm ve mai a ni; Gibea mite chu Benjamina thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu mi chuan khawpui tual laili chu a han en chuan mikhual ṭhu a hmu a, “Khawi lamah nge i kal dâwn? Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Judai ram Bethlehem-ah kan va kal a, Efraim tlâng ram tawpa kan awmnaah kîr leh tur kan ni a, Lalpa inah kal kan tum a ni; tu mah min thleng duh an awm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sabengtung ei tûr buhpâwlte pawh kan intodelh a, kei leh i bawihnu leh tlangvâl tân pawh chaw ei tûr kan nei: neih loh eng mah kan nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Putar chuan, “Mangang hauh suh u, in mamawh zawng zawng chu ka tum vêk ang, khawlaiah zawng riak lul teh suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, a inah a hruai lût a, sabengtungte chu buhpâwl a pe a, an ke an sil a, an eiin an in ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlim taka chaw an ei lai chuan khawpuia mi sual rual chuan in chu an rawn hual a, kawngka chu an rawn chhuih dawt dawt a, in neitu putar hnênah, “I mikhualpa kha han hruai chhuak teh, kan lo pâwl ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In neitupa chu a chhuak a, “Ni lo ve, ka unaute u, chutiang thil ṭha lo tak chu tih tum teh suh u; he mi hi ka ina thleng a ni a, he thil ṭha lo hi a chungah ti suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En teh u, ka fanu, mipa la pâwl loh leh he mi hmei hi, ka rawn la chhuak ang a, in duh leh in tlâwm ang a, in duh ang angin in sawisa dâwn nia; he mi chungah erawh hi chuan thil ṭha lo ti teh suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite chuan a thu an ngaithla duh lo va; chutichuan, kha mi khân a hmei chu a hruai chhuak a, an lo pâwl a, zânkhuain an sawisa a, zîng a lo niha, ni a lo lan dâwn chuan an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu zîngah a pasal thlenna inah chuan a lo kal a, kawngka bulah chuan a tlu tawp a, khaw ên hma chu a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pasal chu zîngah a tho va, kal chhuah tumin kawngka chu a han hawng a, a hmei chu kawngka bulah chuan a lo let dêr a, a kut chuan kawngka chu a ban a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hnênah, “Tho teh, i kal ang,” a ti a; chhâng tûr a lo awm tawh lo va. A sabengtung chungah chuan a dah a, a tho va, a in lamah chuan a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />In a va thlen chuan chem a la a, a hmei fuke chu sâwm leh pahnihah a chan sawm a, Israel ram chhûngah chuan a thawn darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A lo hmu apiang chuan, “Israel-te zîngah Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah aṭanga tûn thlengin hetiang thil hi a la awm ngai lo; ngaihtuah ula, inrawn khâwmin ngaih dân i sawi teh ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu thukhat vuain Mizpa khuaah Lalpa hmaah an pung khâwm a, Dan leh Beer-seba khaw inkâra mi zawng zawng leh Gilead ram mite nên an lo kal khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel hnam tin hruaitute pawh Pathian mite pungkhâwmho zîngah chuan an tel a. Khandaih lek thei ṭhalh mi nuai li an tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte chuan Israel-te chu Mizpa khuaah an pung khâwm tih an lo hria a. Israel mite chuan, “Engtin nge he thil ṭha lo tak hi a lo thlen dân han sawi chiang teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levia chi, an thah tak hmeichhe pasal chuan, “Benjamin-ho khua Gibea ka va thleng a, ka hmei nên hian kan riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibea mite chu zânah mi bei tûrin an lo thawk a, ka thlen in an rawn hual a; min thah an tum a, ka hmeinu chu an sual lui a, a thi ta hial a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hmei chu inah ka hâwn a, a fuke chu ka chan a, Israel ramah ka thawn darh a nih kha; hetiang khawpa tenawmin an hur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Israel fate u, hetah in awm kim vek a, engtia tih tûr nge in ngaih dân sawi teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipui zawng zawng chu thukhat vuain an tho va, “Puan ina awm kan ni emaw, ina awm kan ni emaw, tu mah kan haw lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hetiang hian Gibea chu kan sawisa ang: ṭhumvâwrin kan inbeih chhâwk ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te zinga mi sawma pakhat zelin mipuite ei tur an hlân ang a, mi dang chuan Gibea mite chu hetiang hurna thil tenawm hi an tih avâng hian an ching nek dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel rama mipa zawng zawng chu lungrual takin khua chu tihchhiat tumin an pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel hnamte chuan Benjamin-ho hnam ram tinah zualko an tîr a, “Engtizia nge hetiang thil sual hi in tih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gibea khaw mi, hetiang mi khawloho hi han hruai ula, kan lo that ang e, hetiang thil sual hi Israel zîngah kan tiboral tûr a ni,” an ti a. Mahse, Benjamin-ho chuan Israel-ho thu chu engah mah an ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Benjamin-ho khaw tin aṭang chuan Israel mi dangte lo bei tûrin Gibea khuaah an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gibea khuaa mite bâkah Benjamin mi khaw hrang hrang aṭanga lo kalte chu khandaih keng ṭhalh sînghnih leh sângruk an ni. Gibea mi pawh, thlan chhuah ṭhalh zasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng mi thlan chhuah zînga zasarih chu veikhawr an ni a, virvawmin samzai pawh ṭhelh lovin an vawm chhum thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mi, Benjamin-ho bei tûr chu mi nuaili, khandaih keng ṭhalh, indonaa kal tawh vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite chu an tho va, Bethel-ah an kal a, Pathian an râwn a, “Benjamin-ho bei tûrin tu hnam nge kal hmasa ang?” an ti a. Lalpa chuan, “Juda thlahte kal hmasa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mite chu zîngah an tho va, Gibea khua hualin bûk an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benjamin-ho bei tûr chuan an thawk chhuak a, khaw ep chuan an sipaite an tlar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chu Gibea khua aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a, chumi ni chuan Israel mite chu mi sînghnih leh sânghnih an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite chu an infuih sauh sauh va, a hma nia bei tûra an han insiamna hmunah vêk khân an han intlar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni hma chuan Israel-te chu Lalpa hmaah ṭapin tlai thlengin an awm a, “Kan unau Benjamin-ho bei tûrin kan thawk leh ang em?” tiin an zâwt a. Lalpa chuan, “Bei leh rawh u,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni hnih ni pawh chuan Israel-te chu Benjamin-ho bei tûr chuan an thawk leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chu a ni hnih ni pawh chuan Gibea khua aṭangin an lo chhuak a, khandaih keng ṭhiau mi sîngkhat leh sângriat an that leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu Bethel-ah an chho va, Lalpa hmaah an ṭap a, an ṭhu a, tlai thlengin chaw an nghei a, hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu chutah chuan a awm a, Lalpa chu an râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Arona fa Eleazara fapa Finehasa chu bâwm hmaah chuan a ding a, “Benjamin-ho, kan unaute bei tûrin kan thawk leh dâwn nge dâwn lo?” tiin a zâwt a. Lalpa chuan, “Kal leh rawh u, naktûk chuan in kutah ka pe ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel mite chuan Gibea khaw bulah chângrutu an dah a. Ni dang ang bawkin Israel-te chu, a ni thum ni chuan Benjamin-ho bei tûr chuan an han intlar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chu bei lêt tûrin an lo thawk a, khua ata chu an tlân chhuak a; ni dang ang bawk khân lovah te, kawngpui - Bethel leh Gibea panna kawngah te chuan Israel mi sawmthum zet an that leh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chuan, “Tûn hma ang bawk khân kan that leh ta e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel-te chuan, “Tlânchhia ila, khawpui ata kawngpuiah hian min rawn ûm sela, lo chhuak teh se,” an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel sipai nâwlpui chu Baaltamar-ah an tlân khâwm a, ṭan an lo la ta a; tin, Gibea khaw huala lungpui kâra biruho kha an lo zuang chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûng mi thlan bîk sîngkhat chuan Gibea khua chu an bei ta chiam a, Benjamin-ho chuan an ralthum dâwn tih rêng an inhre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu Benjamin-ho a hnehtîr a, Israel-te chuan mi sînghnih leh sângnga leh za lai an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chuan an chan a chhe ta dêr tih an inhre ta a. Israel sipai bupui chuan Gibea khua huala châng rutu an dahte kha rinchhanin an tawlh kîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gibea khuaah chuan an tlân lût a, an insem darh a, an hmuh apiang an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel sipai bupui leh biruho khân rem an insiam a, khua aṭangin mei khu luih luih an hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />indona hmuna Israel awmte chu lo lêt tûr an ni. Benjamin-ho khân Israel mi sawmthum an that hman tawh a, “Tûn hmaa kan tih ang bawkin kan ti leh dâwn e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khua aṭanga mei a khûk chhoh ngut ngut veleh Benjamin-ho chuan an han thlîr lêt a, khua a kâng ta vek tih an hmuh chuan mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel-te pawh an lo lêt a; Benjamin-ho chuan tihhlum vek an ni mai dâwn tih an inhriat chuan an chiai zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel-ho lak aṭang chuan an tawlh kîr a, tu ma awm lohna lamah tlân an tum a; mahse, an tlân chhuak thei lo, sipai nâwlpui leh khua aṭanga lo tlân chhuakte khân lehlam lehlamah an bei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel-te chuan an hmêlmate chu ruangchaicheh an thlâk hnan a, Gibea chhak lamah an tlân a, an ûm a, an that zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin sipai ṭha ṭha mi sîngkhat leh sângriat an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A ṭhen chu Rimon pûk panin an tlân a, kawngah mi sângnga lai chu an thi bawk a. Israel-te chuan Gidom thlengin an ûm a, mi sânghnih chu an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A vaiin Benjamin-ho chu mi sînghnih leh sângnga, indo mi hlîr, an thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi zaruk erawh chu Rimon pûkah an tlân a, thla li lai chutah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Israel-te chu Benjamin-ho chungah chuan an che zêl a, mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, naupang pawh, an rante chenin an that fai vek a. Chûng lai vêla an khua zawng chu an hâl vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te Mizpa khuaa an pun khâwm khân Lalpa hmaah thu an tiam tlat a, “Tu mahin kan fanute Benjamin-ho kan neihtîr lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite chu Bethel-ah an kal a, Pathian hmaah tlai thlengin an ṭhu a, ring tak leh lungchhe takin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, hetiang thil hi engtia lo thleng nge ni le, Israel-te zîngah Benjamin thlah an boral mai bîk dâwn hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tûkah chuan zîng takah maichâm an siam a, remna thilhlan leh hâlral thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Israel hnam zîngah Mizpa khuaa kal khâwmnaa tel ve lo an awm em?” tiin an inzâwt a. Mizpa khuaa kal lo chu tihhlum tûr an ti a, kal lo an awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-te chuan an unau Benjamin-ho chu an khawngaih a, “Vawiin hian Israel-te chuan kan zînga hnam pakhat kan chân dâwn alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin hnam la damte tân nupui engtin nge kan zawnsak ang? Lalpa hmaah kan fanute chu neihtîr tawp lo tûrin thu kan lo tiam tlat tawh si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mizpa khuaa inkhâwmpuia kal ve lo hnam an awm em tia an han inzawh chian chuan Gilead ram, Jabes khaw mi lo chu an awm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hming an han lam khân Jabes khaw mi chhâng tûr an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pungkhâwmho hotute chuan an zînga mi huaisen sîngkhat leh sânghnih an tîr a, “Kal ula, Jabes khuaa mi zawng zawng, hmeichhia leh naupang lamin va that rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipa that vek ula, hmeichhia pawh, mipa pâwl tawh chu that vek ang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jabes-ho zîngah chuan nula, mipa la pawl loh zali an hmu a, Silo-ah Kanan ramah chuan an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rimon pûka awm Benjamin-ho hnênah palai an tîr a, beih an tum tawh loh thu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chu an lo kîr a, Israel-te chuan Jabes nula, an thah lohho chu, nupuiah an pe a; mahse, an indaih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel inpumkhatna a tihdarh tâk avângin mite chuan pawi an ti a, Benjamin-ho chu an lainat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pungkhâwm hotute chuan, “Benjamin zîngah nupui tûr hmeichhia an awm tawh si lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nupui tûr la nei ve lote tân engtin nge nupui kan zawnsak ang? Israel-te hian kan zînga hnam pakhat mang kan phal tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin-ho din chhuah lehna ngaihtuahpui tûr a ni; kan fanute lah kan neihtîr thei si lo: ‘mahni fanu Benjamin mi neihtîr chu ânchhia dawng rawh se,’ kan lo ti tawh si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Lalpa tâna kum tin Silo khuaa kût awm ṭhîn chu a hun leh ṭêp tawh alâwm,” tiin an ngaihtuah a. (Silo hi Bethel hmâr lam, Bethel aṭanga Sekem panna lamlian khawchhak lama awm, Lebona chhima awm a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benjamin thlahte chu thu an pe a, “Kal ula, grep huanah te lo châng ru ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silo khaw nulate lâm tûr an lo chhuak ang a, grep huan aṭang chuan lo chhuak ula, Silo nulate chu mahni nupui tûr ṭheuh lo man ula, Benjamin ramah in hâwnpui dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An paten emaw, an nuṭaten emaw an rawn sawi buai dâwn pawhin, ‘Khawngaih takin neih hlentîr mai teh u, râl anga inbeiin nupuiah an man pawh a ni lo va; nangni lahin in duh thu-a in pêk a ni hek lo va, in thutiam pawh in bawhchhe hlei nem,’ kan lo ti ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An sawi ang chuan Benjamin-ho chuan an ti a, Silo khuaa nula lâm zînga mi mahni nupui tûr ṭheuh an man a, an ramah an hâwnpui a, an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel dangte chu mahni ram chanpualah an chi leh hnam ram ṭheuhvah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Israel ramah lal an awm lo, ṭha an tih ang angin mi tin an awm mai a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
